    {
      "text": "God hath shewed thee all this, Gen. 41:39. by every word that proceedeth out of the mouth of the Lord doth man live, Deut. 8:3 (Matt. 4:4; D&C 98:11). in those days; there was no open vision, 1 Sam. 3:1. after the fire a still small voice, 1 Kgs. 19:12. God speaketh once, yea twice, Job 33:14. Where there is no vision, the people perish, Prov. 29:18. God hath made known to the king, Dan. 2:45.",
